<title>USA: Adage Q3 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Adage Q3 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   loss		 $0.02     loss	 $0.14</p>
<p> Net   loss		    84     loss	   731</p>
<p> Sales		     18,608		  19,257</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,127		    5,105</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.04     loss	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net    profit		193     loss	 1,032</p>
<p> Sales		     59,074		   62,130</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,124		    5,101</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Adage Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said third quarter 1996 revenues declined due to a $5 million revenue decline at Ft. Orange Paper, from decreased volume and price reductions.</p>
